From 5e83272daced57312c01264018fb1394c23a7caf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: migridgal <92881435+Ridawo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 12:59:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix: close broken access control, hardcoded secrets and NoSQL
 injection across the API

- centralize JWT auth into a shared verifyToken middleware (src/back/api/security.js)
- apply it to every write endpoint in v1/v2, not just one (was 1/6 protected, now 6/6)
- move JWT secret and admin credentials from source code into env vars
- reject non-string filter values to block NoSQL operator injection (?field[$ne]=...)
---
 .env.example               | 11 +++++++
 src/back/api/api-JFM-v2.js | 15 +++++----
 src/back/api/api-JFM.js    | 15 +++++----
 src/back/api/api-MRG-v2.js | 39 ++++------------------
 src/back/api/api-MRG.js    | 13 ++++----
 src/back/api/api-TGG-v2.js | 11 ++++---
 src/back/api/api-TGG.js    | 11 ++++---
 src/back/api/security.js   | 66 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/back/index.js          |  3 --
 9 files changed, 118 insertions(+), 66 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/back/api/security.js

